@startuml
title SC1 – Activate and Arm

actor RPIC
participant UAV
participant DroneResponse

RPIC -> UAV : 1: deactivateSafetySwitch()

DroneResponse -> UAV : 2: arm()
activate UAV

UAV -> UAV : 3–4: executeTests(PREARM)
UAV -> UAV : 5: executeArm()
UAV -> UAV : 6: setState(MISSION)

UAV --> DroneResponse : 7: armedAndReady
deactivate UAV
@enduml
